=== My L1 grammar ===
  'a'      -> False
  'aa'     -> False
  'aaaa'   -> False
  'ab'     -> False

=== My L3 attempt ===
  'abc'        -> False
  'aabbcc'     -> False
  'aaabbbccc'  -> False
